<title>UK: European cotton markets slow due holiday.</title>
<headline>European cotton markets slow due holiday.</headline>
<dateline>LIVERPOOL 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The absence of a clear lead from Friday's session of New York futures, coupled with today's holiday in several countries made for dull trading conditions in most European raw cotton markets.</p>
<p>A tentative enquiry was in evidence for current crop Central Asian and West African styles, but activity generally remained at a very low ebb.</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
